## Customize flags given to the VM: https://www.erlang.org/doc/man/erl.html
## -mode/-name/-sname/-setcookie are configured via env vars, do not set them here

## The port table is sized from this. Without it the VM takes the process's
## open-files limit, which container runtimes set to about a billion, and the
## table alone then costs 1.6 GB at boot — the pod is OOM-killed before it
## runs a line of code. 65536 is the VM's own default when the limit is sane.
+Q 65536
